--- !u!114 &1407237988
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1407237986}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "In a not-so-distant future, Earth is drowning in waste, and who gets the
    stellar job of cleaning it up? ASTROBOLT! A lone astronaut, armed with determination
    is sent to chuck Earth\u2019s trash into space.\n\U0001F4A5 Plot twist: Fuel
    runs out mid-mission, and Astrobolt crash-land on Planet X, a wild, uncharted
    world where garbage fights back! \nTo escape, you must outsmart the waste monsters,
    and harness the planet\u2019s sustainable energy (solar panels, wind turbines\u2014nature\u2019s
    cheat codes! \U0001F31E\U0001F4A8). But wait\u2014what if leaving isn\u2019t
    the answer? \U0001F914\nThrough wind-credible quizzes, and some suntastic discoveries,
    you\u2019ll realize that saving Earth isn\u2019t about running away from its
    mess, but learning to clean up our act! \U0001F331\u267B\uFE0F\nReady to turn
    waste into wonder? Strap in, Astrobolt\u2014Planet X awaits! \U0001F680\U0001F525\n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
